     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there, <div><br></div><div>Is the D-RUG still meeting regularly this quarter? I haven&#39;t received any updates this quarter yet and I was concerned. </div><div><br></div><div>Let me know when you get a chance. </div><div><br></div><div>Thank you in advance. </div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Suzette </div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
